@ops = http://localhost:5101
@viewer = PASTE_ALICE_TOKEN_HERE
@operator = PASTE_BOB_TOKEN_HERE

### Order 123 (gateway_timeout x2)
GET {{ops}}/orders/123
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer}}

### Failures in the last 24 h
GET {{ops}}/payments/failures?sinceHours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer}}

### Stock for DK-900 (low stock)
GET {{ops}}/inventory/DK-900
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer}}

### Viewer tries to reserve -> 403
POST {{ops}}/inventory/DK-900/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1, "orderId": 123, "reason": "test" }

### Operator reserves 1 -> 200
POST {{ops}}/inventory/DK-900/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{operator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1, "orderId": 123, "reason": "manual test" }

### Over-reserve -> 409
POST {{ops}}/inventory/DK-900/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{operator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 40, "orderId": 123, "reason": "should fail" }

### Retry fraud order -> 409
POST {{ops}}/orders/142/payments/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{operator}}
